  󱙺 argus                                                                                                           

  Tree                                             Pane
  ↑ k/↓ j            move · prev                   ↑ k/↓ j    move / scroll · prev
  gg/G shift+g       top / bottom · goto bottom    enter      open session · open
  ^u pgup/^d pgdown  page · scroll half-page-down  O shift+o  jump to its tmux pane · open tmux-pane
  h ← zc/l → zo      fold / unfold · fold close    esc        close / tree · back
  enter              open; l opens Home/workspace  dd         kill session · session kill
  ^ww/^wW            cycle focus · focus next      za         active / all sessions · toggle active-only
  /                  filter · filter-projects      /          filter sessions · filter-sessions
                                                   L shift+l  workspace setup log · open setup-log
                                                   ^wh/^wl    focus left / right pane · focus left
                                                   ^wj        session: focus the prompt · focus down
                                                   gT/gt      right sidebar: Files / Changes · tab next
                                                   t          changes: uncommitted / vs target · toggle diff-vs-target
                                                   esc h      changes: back from a commit · back
                                                   ]f/[f      diff: next / previous file · next diff-file
                                                   yow        open file: wrap long lines · toggle line-wrap

  Manage (tree)                                               Screen
  a          new workspace (branch/PR/issue) · workspace new  ^k         go to a session or a place · open palette
  dd         remove workspace · workspace remove              s          spawn in the selected workspace · session spawn
  D shift+d  force remove · workspace force-remove            ^w</^w>    resize focused sidebar · sidebar wider
  r          rename project · project rename                  ␣e         toggle right sidebar · toggle right-sidebar
  F shift+f  forget project (files stay) · project forget     ␣o         toggle sidebar · toggle left-sidebar
  P shift+p  pin / unpin project · project pin                gr         refresh · refresh
  H shift+h  hide / unhide project · project hide             g?         help · help
  z.         show hidden · toggle show-hidden                 Q shift+q  quit · quit

                                               ↑/↓ scroll · any key close